{"data":[{"author_id":"1365719593902366721","created_at":"2026-10-13T20:37:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110107599488106600"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/elonmusk/statu…","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/elonmusk/status/2109690977279426846","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/7klJ0knxIK"}]},"id":"2110107599488106600","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":39,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"What you mean is, when they steal a technology they can scale it fast.\n\nThey stole advanced lithium battery designs. Claimed they had cracked lithography but they hadn't, because ASML keeps an extremely tight lid on it. Same with HBM memory and 3D chip packaging, CoWoS w TSMC etc https://t.co/7klJ0knxIK","url":"https://x.com/OutlierBlackBox/status/2110107599488106600"},{"author_id":"22144148","created_at":"2026-10-14T07:10:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110266934818201662"],"id":"2110266934818201662","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":24,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI chip supply chain -days\n\n1. Raw materials / wafers \n2. ASML EUV machines → 100-150 days \n3. Wafer fab (TSMC etc.) → 100-120 days \n4. HBM memory\n 5. Advanced packaging (CoWoS) → 40-70 days \n6. AI chips (NVIDIA etc.) \n7. Servers / data centers\n\nTotal cycle: 200 days","url":"https://x.com/systeemplafonds/status/2110266934818201662"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109799763436826624"]},"author_id":"1637442460208222209","created_at":"2026-10-13T23:00:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110143550738272759"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"2025 was another strong year for TSMC. We observed robust AI-related demand throughout the year, while non-AI end market segments bottomed out and witnessed a mild recovery. Concluding 2025, the Foundry 2.0 industry increased 16% year-over-year. Supported by our strong technology differentiation and broad customer base, TSMC’s revenue increased 35.9% year-over-year in US dollar terms, and both our revenue and EPS set new record highs. In 2025, developments in the AI market continued to be very positive.","display_url":"investor.tsmc.com/static/annualR…","end":142,"expanded_url":"https://investor.tsmc.com/static/annualReports/2025/english/index.html","images":[{"height":937,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110143562469789697/Z32_zYFY?format=jpg&name=orig","width":610},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110143562469789697/Z32_zYFY?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":119,"status":200,"title":"TSMC 2025 Annual Report Website","unwound_url":"https://investor.tsmc.com/static/annualReports/2025/english/index.html","url":"https://t.co/rZbz6yDfMc"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/tmrpBY1ZTt","end":166,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/MIA_AIresearch/status/2110143550738272759/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109799763436826624","start":143,"url":"https://t.co/tmrpBY1ZTt"}]},"id":"2110143550738272759","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI向け半導体は微細な演算チップだけでは完成しない。TSMCのCoWoSはロジックとHBMを近接実装し、帯域と供給量を支える。2025年報告書はAI需要によるCoWoSの成長を明記。MIAの分析：先端工程と実装能力の両方が競争力。 出典：https://t.co/rZbz6yDfMc https://t.co/tmrpBY1ZTt","url":"https://x.com/MIA_AIresearch/status/2110143550738272759"},{"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:24:40.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109847761361510792"],"id":"2109847761361510792","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"대만 TSMC와 첨단 패키징 공급망 관련 중요 업데이트입니다.\n\n파워칩(PSMC), TSMC CoWoS 이어 인텔 EMIB 공급망도 진입…\"2027년 하반기 월 투입량 1만 장 목표\"\n\n현재 TSMC의 선단 파운드리와 CoWoS 어드밴스드 패키징 생산능력(CAPA)이 2026년까지 거의 풀가동 상태라는 점이 글로벌 AI 가속기","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2109847761361510792"},{"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:32:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109879825825767620"],"id":"2109879825825767620","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":44,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"대만 TSMC와 첨단 패키징 공급망 관련 중요 업데이트입니다.\n\n파워칩(PSMC), TSMC CoWoS 이어 인텔 EMIB 공급망도 진입…\"2027년 하반기 월 투입량 1만 장 목표\"\n\n현재 TSMC의 선단 파운드리와 CoWoS 어드밴스드 패키징 생산능력(CAPA)이 2026년까지 거의 풀가동 상태라는 점이 글로벌 AI 가속기","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2109879825825767620"},{"author_id":"1464430347333083145","created_at":"2026-10-14T02:45:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110200263403557329"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/khoomeik/statu…","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/khoomeik/status/2110137241968460006","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/PxEDlBunJo"}]},"id":"2110200263403557329","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":2842,"like_count":53,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"CoWoS, the packaging that holds today's AI chips, was once a joke inside TSMC :))\n\nShang-yi Chiang, a former TSMC co-COO, says he proposed a packaging unit and Morris Chang approved it quickly. But CoWoS was too expensive. \n\nA Qualcomm executive told him over dinner the price had https://t.co/PxEDlBunJo","url":"https://x.com/Fintech03/status/2110200263403557329"},{"article":{"title":"10 Semiconductor Equipment Stories That Matter in 2026"},"author_id":"2992000138","created_at":"2026-10-13T06:57:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109901309679976764"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2109…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2109893490964680704","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2109893490964680704","url":"https://t.co/Qcs2SQafYJ"}]},"id":"2109901309679976764","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":127,"impression_count":31177,"like_count":75,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":9},"text":"https://t.co/Qcs2SQafYJ","url":"https://x.com/NuttyCLD/status/2109901309679976764"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110348239350484992"]},"author_id":"1017600061910351872","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:34:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110348414605275235"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/MmRQqdRnsz","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ItsCluxie/status/2110348414605275235/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110348239350484992","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/MmRQqdRnsz"}]},"id":"2110348414605275235","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":92,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Soal AI chip, yang jadi bottleneck sekarang bukan lagi bikin chipnya, tapi membungkusnya. Advanced packaging adalah langkah terakhir yang menyambungkan GPU dengan memori HBM jadi satu accelerator yang bisa dipakai.\n\nTSMC menguasai sekitar 90% kapasitas packaging yang dibutuhkan https://t.co/MmRQqdRnsz","url":"https://x.com/ItsCluxie/status/2110348414605275235"},{"author_id":"2080404863838531584","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:41:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110214313747108240"],"id":"2110214313747108240","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":97,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"TSMC JUST OUTSOURCED ITS OWN BOTTLENECK\n\nTSMC's CEO called CoWoS capacity sold out. This week TSMC signed a five-year, $2B deal for GlobalFoundries to manufacture silicon interposers in Malta, New York.\n\nThe interposer is the passive silicon slab that stitches chiplets and HBM","url":"https://x.com/ChokepointRes/status/2110214313747108240"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["7_2109969935652810752"]},"author_id":"2104156899151425536","created_at":"2026-10-13T11:30:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109969965008732239"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/2vQfQbYWkF","end":215,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/secondordertkn/status/2109969965008732239/video/1","media_key":"7_2109969935652810752","start":192,"url":"https://t.co/2vQfQbYWkF"}]},"id":"2109969965008732239","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A wafer is not a shippable AI GPU until packaging joins the die to HBM.\n\nOSAT firms package chips they did not make. TSMC CoWoS is captive packaging, not an OSAT. Stuck step: packaging slots. https://t.co/2vQfQbYWkF","url":"https://x.com/secondordertkn/status/2109969965008732239"},{"author_id":"3567952932","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:36:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109911258736841051"],"id":"2109911258736841051","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"先进封装不只在台积电手里：多家预测 TSMC CoWoS 约从 2026 年底 ~13 万片/月扩到 2028 年底 ~26 万片/月；同期 spillover 流向 ASE、Amkor（合计约 11 万片 CoWoS 当量），Intel EMIB-T 约 4–4.5 万片当量，硅中介层还有 GlobalFoundries / UMC / VIS。AI 加速器堆 HBM","url":"https://x.com/_MO_DAO/status/2109911258736841051"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110144002259361792"]},"author_id":"1961197062428729344","created_at":"2026-10-13T23:01:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110144005354762388"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/IVDYszyjAD","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Valueinvest101/status/2110144005354762388/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110144002259361792","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/IVDYszyjAD"}]},"id":"2110144005354762388","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":79,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"In August 2018, GlobalFoundries told its customers it was giving up on 7-nanometer logic. The company had co-developed the process with IBM, lined up AMD as the launch customer, and then stopped. The reasoning was that too few customers would commit to the volumes 7nm required to https://t.co/IVDYszyjAD","url":"https://x.com/Valueinvest101/status/2110144005354762388"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110165930303209472"]},"author_id":"1815933077895737344","created_at":"2026-10-14T00:31:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110166501735137583"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":21,"start":16,"tag":"CBRS"},{"end":94,"start":89,"tag":"CXMT"},{"end":171,"start":166,"tag":"CBRS"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"688825.SS","end":119,"expanded_url":"https://688825.SS","start":96,"unwound_url":"https://688825.SS","url":"https://t.co/dkm2SU75WU"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/vzfpHvB4Qv","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Nodus42/status/2110166501735137583/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110165930303209472","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/vzfpHvB4Qv"},{"display_url":"x.com/ren_stocks/sta…","end":325,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/ren_stocks/status/2110087774120317119","start":302,"url":"https://t.co/LTOnr5OcJk"}]},"id":"2110166501735137583","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":270,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The part of the $CBRS story that gets missed on a day like today...\n\nMemory got nuked on $CXMT (https://t.co/dkm2SU75WU) headlines. Cerebras doesn't use HBM at all.\n\n$CBRS CEO Andrew Feldman on the Q1 call: \"the binding constraint in the market right now is HBM memory. It's in https://t.co/vzfpHvB4Qv https://t.co/LTOnr5OcJk","url":"https://x.com/Nodus42/status/2110166501735137583"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109853663510573056"]},"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:48:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109853676131274978"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/tF34jprId4","end":207,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2109853676131274978/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109853663510573056","start":184,"url":"https://t.co/tF34jprId4"}]},"id":"2109853676131274978","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":33,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"대만 TSMC와 첨단 패키징 공급망 관련 중요 업데이트입니다.\n\n파워칩(PSMC), TSMC CoWoS 이어 인텔 EMIB 공급망도 진입…\"2027년 하반기 월 투입량 1만 장 목표\"\n\n현재 TSMC의 선단 파운드리와 CoWoS 어드밴스드 패키징 생산능력(CAPA)이 2026년까지 거의 풀가동 상태라는 점이 글로벌 AI 가속기 https://t.co/tF34jprId4","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2109853676131274978"},{"author_id":"2079197307602632704","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:43:41.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109943144699846834"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":58,"start":53,"tag":"ASML"},{"end":63,"start":59,"tag":"TSM"}]},"id":"2109943144699846834","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":687,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"text":"오늘 삼전닉스 보고 마음 무거웠던 사람들한테 그나마 기대해볼 만한 소식 하나 있음 \n\n이번 주 $ASML $TSM 실적인데, 캐파 확장 얘기가 기대 이상으로 나오면 삼전닉스한테도 반등 동력이 될 수 있음. 14일(수) ASML, 15일(목) TSMC 순서로 발표함\n\n실적 자체는 이미 잘 나올 걸로 다들 알고 있음.","url":"https://x.com/TechSaurus/status/2109943144699846834"},{"author_id":"2028927791451013120","created_at":"2026-10-13T21:49:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110125818026262954"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":188,"id":"113130846","start":176,"username":"ycombinator"},{"end":243,"id":"1528558014","start":229,"username":"patrick_oshag"},{"end":262,"id":"740238495952736256","start":253,"username":"NVIDIAAI"}]},"id":"2110125818026262954","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"The most technical semiconductor podcasts, per our transcript data (Jun 27–Oct 13):\n\nChip-engineering terms per hour (wafer, HBM, EUV, CoWoS, SRAM, foundry, interconnect…):\n1. @ycombinator Lightcone: 8.2\n2. Invest Like the Best (@patrick_oshag): 4.9\n3. @NVIDIAAI AI Podcast: 3.4","url":"https://x.com/podsignal/status/2110125818026262954"},{"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:05:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109843051904745619"],"id":"2109843051904745619","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"대만 TSMC와 첨단 패키징 공급망 관련 중요 업데이트입니다.\n\nTSMC 6월 매출 68% 폭증…AI 반도체는 아직 ‘정점’을 지나지 않았다\n\n현재 TSMC의 선단 파운드리와 CoWoS 어드밴스드 패키징 생산능력(CAPA)이 2026년까지 거의 풀가동 상태라는 점이 글로벌 AI 가속기 공급의 핵심 병목으로 꼽히고","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2109843051904745619"},{"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-13T05:13:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109875122278642029"],"id":"2109875122278642029","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":51,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"대만 TSMC와 첨단 패키징 공급망 관련 중요 업데이트입니다.\n\nTSMC 6월 매출 68% 폭증…AI 반도체는 아직 ‘정점’을 지나지 않았다\n\n현재 TSMC의 선단 파운드리와 CoWoS 어드밴스드 패키징 생산능력(CAPA)이 2026년까지 거의 풀가동 상태라는 점이 글로벌 AI 가속기 공급의 핵심 병목으로 꼽히고","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2109875122278642029"},{"author_id":"1642917276763709441","created_at":"2026-10-14T12:22:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110345552584171683"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":142,"start":137,"tag":"TSMC"},{"end":147,"start":143,"tag":"半導体"},{"end":151,"start":148,"tag":"AI"},{"end":155,"start":152,"tag":"投資"},{"end":159,"start":156,"tag":"決算"}]},"id":"2110345552584171683","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":103,"like_count":2,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"【10/15 TSMC決算に注目👀】\n\n明日はTSMCの決算。AI半導体需要の強さに加え、3nm・2nm、CoWoSなど先端半導体への投資動向が焦点。\n\nASMLが示した強いAI需要を、TSMCがどう裏付けるのか。\n\n売上高だけでなく、4Q見通しと設備投資にも注目です📈\n\n#TSMC #半導体 #AI #投資 #決算","url":"https://x.com/0ajZFTMFyU4144/status/2110345552584171683"},{"author_id":"1087168568037240832","created_at":"2026-10-13T10:30:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109954896271212911"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":4,"start":0,"tag":"TSM"}]},"id":"2109954896271212911","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2723,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"$TSM Earnings: The Real Test Is 2027\n\nTaiwan Semiconductor reports Q3 earnings on October 15. As the world’s leading chip foundry, TSMC is a key checkpoint for the entire AI trade.\n\nHere’s what I’m watching\n\n1. Revenue &amp; Growth Outlook\n• Consensus revenue: $45.7B (+38% YoY)\n•","url":"https://x.com/InvestmentGuru_/status/2109954896271212911"},